  "question": {
    "text": "The area (in square units) of the region bounded by the parabola <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></math> and the line <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></math>."
